@startuml
title PG 物理备份 - 交互流程
autonumber

actor 用户
participant "KME 接口" as KME
participant "工作流引擎" as WF
database "KME 数据库" as DB
participant "Agent(备份机)" as A_Backup
participant "Agent(PG 主机)" as A_PG
participant "Postgres" as PG
participant "备份仓库" as Repo

用户 -> KME: 触发物理备份(inst_id, policy)
KME -> WF: 创建流程实例
WF -> DB: 插入 backup_task(status=Running)

== 校验与加锁 ==
WF -> KME: 步骤 ValidateAndLock
KME -> DB: 校验运行中任务\n加实例锁
alt 校验失败
  KME -> DB: 更新 backup_task(status=Failed, err)
  WF <-- KME: 步骤失败
  return
end

== 备份仓库准备 ==
WF -> A_Backup: 步骤 PrepareRepo(repo_path, tool_version)
A_Backup -> Repo: 初始化仓库 / stanza-create
A_Backup -> WF: 上报步骤结果(success, log_ref)

== 主机准备 ==
WF -> A_PG: 步骤 PrepareHost(pg_user, ssh, deps)
A_PG -> PG: 创建用户/权限检查
A_PG -> WF: 上报步骤结果(success, log_ref)

== 应用配置 ==
WF -> A_Backup: 步骤 ConfigApply(备份机配置)
A_Backup -> Repo: 写入 pgbackrest.conf
A_Backup -> WF: 上报步骤结果(success)

WF -> A_PG: 步骤 ConfigApply(PG 主机配置)
A_PG -> PG: 写入 pgbackrest.conf
A_PG -> WF: 上报步骤结果(success)

== 执行备份 ==
WF -> A_Backup: 步骤 RunBackup(type=full/diff/incr)
A_Backup -> PG: pgbackrest 备份
A_Backup -> Repo: 写入备份数据/WAL
A_Backup -> WF: 上报步骤结果(success, label, size, duration)
alt 备份失败
  A_Backup -> WF: 上报步骤结果(failed, err)
  WF -> DB: 更新 backup_task(status=Failed, err)
  return
end

== 校验(可选) ==
WF -> A_Backup: 步骤 VerifyBackup(label)
A_Backup -> Repo: pgbackrest check/verify
A_Backup -> WF: 上报步骤结果(success)

== 保留策略 ==
WF -> A_Backup: 步骤 Retention(policy)
A_Backup -> Repo: pgbackrest expire
A_Backup -> WF: 上报步骤结果(success)

== 收尾 ==
WF -> KME: 步骤 Finalize
KME -> DB: 更新 backup_task(status=Success, meta)
KME -> DB: 释放锁
KME -> WF: 步骤成功

@enduml
